  "Scenes.Alicescene.AliceFoxIntro.WanderingBrushFamiliarAura": "Wandering through the brush, a familiar sensation of demonic aura washes over you. You have an idea of where it may be coming from, but it seems as though it's not meant for you this time. Accompanying the aura is the yapping of some wild animal as well."
